<Tunnel title="Find a Computer | Save My Gig!" status="Quick_Fix">
  <div class="review-flag">DRAFT, review pending.</div>
  <div class="step-label">Step 0</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">You have time, use it to find a computer</h2>

  <p>A proper fix needs Rekordbox. With 1-3 hours, you can usually get to one:</p>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>Your own laptop at home or in the car?</li>
    <li>Another DJ on the lineup with Rekordbox installed.</li>
    <li>The venue or promoter's office computer (Rekordbox is a free download).</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="question">Did you get access to a computer?</p>

  <Choice step="qf_find_computer"
    a={{ href: '/protocol/quick-fix/usb-check', label: 'YES - GOT ONE' }}
    b={{ href: '/protocol/critical', label: 'NO - SWITCH TO WORKAROUNDS', desc: 'No computer means no real repair. We use the critical path to get you playing.' }}
  />
</Tunnel>
